P phi 5 2 2 c32:0 5 v8:32
P assign 6 slt 2 v5:32 c32:3
P br v6:1 4 6
P block
P assign 14 sadd.ovf 2 v4:32 c32:1
P check v14:1 ovf+ INT-SIGNED-OVF
P assign 7 add 2 v4:32 c32:1
P jmp 5
P block
P assign 15 sadd.ovf 2 v5:32 c32:1
P check v15:1 ovf+ INT-SIGNED-OVF
P assign 8 add 2 v5:32 c32:1
P jmp 3
P block
P phi 9 1 3 v4:32
P jmp 7
P block
P assign 16 sadd.ovf 2 v1:32 c32:1
P check v16:1 ovf+ INT-SIGNED-OVF
P assign 10 add 2 v1:32 c32:1
P jmp 1
